    "detailed_description": "<strong>\u25a0Middle school student, Girl! is!</strong><br>The girl, who was frustrated by her uncle's overprotection, wakes up in a strange forest. All she got is only a machete. <br>&quot;Where am I? but... first of all, hungry!&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512910/extras/c2d6642c36e748e2d7442b13b2a02197.poster.avif?t=1729847869\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512910/extras/c2d6642c36e748e2d7442b13b2a02197.webm?t=1729847869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512910/extras/c2d6642c36e748e2d7442b13b2a02197.mp4?t=1729847869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>\u25a0Enjoy a simple and short story that saves the world!</strong><br>The girl has no experience of reincarnation, no special ability. Just a little survival knowledge and a healthy body.<br>But coincidence, necessity, and small warm hearts come together, and the girl...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512910/extras/d412e96b90fe8c7294803dab4ef94bd1.poster.avif?t=1729847869\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512910/extras/d412e96b90fe8c7294803dab4ef94bd1.webm?t=1729847869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512910/extras/d412e96b90fe8c7294803dab4ef94bd1.mp4?t=1729847869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\u25a0Easy and simple battle</strong><br>Avoid enemies when they come, and if you see a gap, join forces in machete and hit them!<br>Often, using other tool than machete makes it easier to fight battles.<br><br><spa